  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop brown onion.\n• Thinly slice capsicum into strips.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.\n• Slice kernels off the corn cob.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beecf83f90c073aba9cea/step-e2223f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and capsicum, stirring, until softened, 5-6 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beecf83f90c073aba9cea/step-09467410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan, add corn and black beans and cook, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• SPICY! You may find the spice blend hot. Add less if you’re sensitive to heat. Add Mexican Fiesta spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in the water, then simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes. Season with salt and pepper. Divide mixture into equal portions.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beecf83f90c073aba9cea/step-1935f420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place one mini flourtortilla on an oven tray. Top with one portion of the bean mixture and spread in an even layer. Sprinkle with a little Cheddar cheese (save some for the top!), then top with another tortilla. Add the next portion of bean mixture on top, then sprinkle with cheese and top with another tortilla. Repeat until all tortillas and bean mixture have been used up.\n• Sprinkle remaining Cheddar cheese over the top.\n• Bake until cheese is melted and golden, 10-12 minutes.\n• TIP: If you’re cooking for 4 or 6 people, build two or three stacks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beecf83f90c073aba9cea/step-2adc7030.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the stack is baking, roughly chop tomato, cucumber and pickled jalapeños (if using).\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste, then add cucumber, tomato and jalapeños. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beecf83f90c073aba9cea/step-f3c86240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Using a bread knife, cut tortilla stack into wedges (like a cake!) and divide between plates.\n• Top with light sour cream.\n• Serve with jalapeño salsa. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689beecf83f90c073aba9cea/step-3c0b5650.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
